# Cognevance TaskFlow — MERN Task Manager

## 1. Project Overview

TaskFlow is a full-stack task management web application built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js). It helps users organise their tasks, set deadlines, assign priorities and track completion through a dark, burgundy-themed dashboard.

Users sign up and log in securely with JSON Web Tokens (JWT) and bcrypt password hashing. Task data is stored in MongoDB and served through REST APIs.

## 2. Project Objectives

- Implement secure registration and login using JWT and bcrypt.
- Develop REST APIs using Node.js and Express.js.
- Implement Create, Read, Update and Delete (CRUD) operations for tasks.
- Store user and task information in MongoDB.
- Build an interactive React.js dashboard.
- Support task filtering, status updates and deadlines.
- Test the APIs and deploy the application online.

## 3. Technologies Used

- **Frontend:** React.js, Vite, React Router, HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js
- **Database:** MongoDB Atlas with Mongoose
- **Authentication:** JSON Web Token (JWT)
- **Password security:** bcrypt
- **HTTP requests:** Fetch API
- **Security middleware:** Helmet and CORS
- **Hosting:** Vercel (frontend and backend)
- **Version control:** Git and GitHub

## 4. Features

- User registration and login with hashed passwords.
- JWT-based authentication on all task routes.
- Create, view, edit and delete tasks.
- Task descriptions, deadlines and priorities (High, Medium, Low).
- Status updates: To do, In progress, Done. Click a task's circle to move it forward.
- Filter tasks by status or overdue, filter by priority, and search by text.
- Calendar with deadline markers. Click a day to filter tasks due on it.
- Overdue highlighting with plain labels such as "Due tomorrow" and "Overdue by 2 days".
- Dashboard with stat cards, a 7-day deadline chart and a progress donut.
- Responsive layout for desktop, tablet and mobile.
- Each user can see and change only their own tasks.

