## 13. Deployment

- **Frontend URL:** https://anveez-taskflow-deploy-2026.vercel.app
- **Backend API URL:** https://cognevance-task-flow.vercel.app/api
- **API health check:** https://cognevance-task-flow.vercel.app/api/health
- **GitHub repository:** https://github.com/anveez/cognevance_TaskFlow

Production configuration:

- Backend variables: `MONGODB_URI`, `JWT_SECRET`, `CLIENT_URL` (the frontend address, no trailing slash).
- Frontend variable: `VITE_API_URL` (the backend address ending in `/api`).
- MongoDB Atlas Network Access allows connections from the hosting platform.

## 14. Security Considerations

- Passwords are hashed with bcrypt before storage and never returned by the API.
- JWT secrets and database credentials are kept in environment variables and excluded from Git.
- Task endpoints enforce ownership on the backend, so users can only reach their own tasks.
- Protected routes reject missing, invalid or expired tokens.
- CORS allows only the configured frontend origin.
- Helmet sets secure HTTP headers.

